<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-30T02:04:16.364Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:04:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drone strikes hit a Darfur market, killing more than 100 civilians and also damaged a power station, cutting electricity to two states. The Sudanese army is accused of launching 162 drone attacks from Ethiopian territory, a claim Ethiopia denies. A UN agency reports that nearly 120,000 people have been displaced in Blue Nile state since January. The UAE federal court sentenced eight Sudanese defendants to life imprisonment for illegal arms trafficking to the Sudanese army, and there were 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPWkJTOVR2MzAyWEJiZG9IUzdraU9WU3VoVG1NUVlLdFFLblR2Q21HTEdPZGJvSFdCZk1vZllNOEk5Tmd2ZlNEMDlGbEdQU3pZa2wxVEJ4Rk9DRnowYkE4UENuZ2tPbHJjalZEZXhKQ3pmOGhxUWdGbzdpMWppXzJvaGx5TkIyQTAtWFZZb3cxNVh2UWNmLVRJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFA4Ml8zTWxDb3BONnN4dVZfZEkzWkx3cGpLMEpSRXZ5V3ZQSmFHYk8tazNKNjJIRFVRZl8xRGNmZG95NmVZTXMwRTJ5NWhyWExDVlBBLXBWbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPcUlCZzJFdzBSRXpud2FDSnB0ZWJwTEJENVEtSFN0WFZQQ2FrVHo2Y2c4ejhSYWpXemJrTExMcE5IbWZsYlNNeklvTHd6UGtFWWp0alpUOGwzY1lWbFlhMUwtQkFOaW5uS1NuTGNiUWdZZWM2Z2IwVG1qMzRhVnFKVUhDZE42VGwxOUpDVGNOenlZUkV1MWlYTEJXWFBucmdBWEFTVk9qSzBxSE5BVms4dXRRSC1CcjlQUGlqYnJBQzd5ZEt3RG8tSg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5KVFM0SWhfalRxZlh2QkdaMGsyenR2d2pfTnJ6a19XOFkwN2dCZE02ZUFQVVhLdjN0QnNqZFZDNWc1MjBtNUZaRUNXSXlC